text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando se realiza o Trail dos Arrozais 2026?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento realiza-se no domingo, 27 de setembro de 2026, com in\u00edcio das partidas \u00e0s 08h30 no Largo da Igreja de S. Pedro em Paradela, \u00c1gueda.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias e altimetrias do evento?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O programa conta com o Trail Longo de 24 km (1120m D+), Trail Curto de 17 km (850m D+), Mini-Trail de 10 km (525m D+), Caminhada de 7.5 km (280m D+) e Trail Kids de 1 km.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde se localiza o secretariado e levantamento de dorsais?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O secretariado funciona no Sal\u00e3o da Igreja de S. Pedro no s\u00e1bado (26 de setembro) das 16h00 \u00e0s 19h30 e no domingo da prova a partir das 07h00.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">O evento integra algum trof\u00e9u ou campeonato?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Sim, o Trail dos Arrozais integra como 4\u00aa etapa o Trof\u00e9u de Trail Terras de \u00c1gueda e \u00e9 homologado pela FPA.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os prazos e valores de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es decorrem na plataforma Lap2Go at\u00e9 21 de setembro, variando entre 10,00 \u20ac (caminhada) e 11,00 \u20ac a 17,00 \u20ac (provas de trail), sendo o Trail Kids gratuito.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Trail dos Arrozais 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-09-27\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Largo da Igreja de S. Pedro, Paradela\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"\u00c1gueda\", \"addressRegion\": \"Aveiro\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"organizer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Sport Clube Paradela\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quando se realiza o Trail dos Arrozais 2026?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O evento realiza-se no domingo, 27 de setembro de 2026, com in\u00edcio das partidas \u00e0s 08h30 no Largo da Igreja de S. Pedro em Paradela, \u00c1gueda.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias e altimetrias do evento?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O programa conta com o Trail Longo de 24 km (1120m D+), Trail Curto de 17 km (850m D+), Mini-Trail de 10 km (525m D+), Caminhada de 7.5 km (280m D+) e Trail Kids de 1 km.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Onde se localiza o secretariado e levantamento de dorsais?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O secretariado funciona no Sal\u00e3o da Igreja de S. Pedro no s\u00e1bado (26 de setembro) das 16h00 \u00e0s 19h30 e no domingo da prova a partir das 07h00.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"O evento integra algum trof\u00e9u ou campeonato?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Sim, o Trail dos Arrozais integra como 4\u00aa etapa o Trof\u00e9u de Trail Terras de \u00c1gueda e \u00e9 homologado pela FPA.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o os prazos e valores de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es decorrem na plataforma Lap2Go at\u00e9 21 de setembro, variando entre 10,00 \u20ac (caminhada) e 11,00 \u20ac a 17,00 \u20ac (provas de trail), sendo o Trail Kids gratuito.\"}}]}<\/script><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":66200,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[672,22,497,739,498],"event_ty